ernal website.",userConsent:"You're being redirected to an external website. By proceeding, your details will be shared with the relevant department.",exactMatchHint:'For an exact match, put the words in quotes. For example: "Scheme Name".',schemeInitiated:"It seems you have already initiated your application earlier.",externalApplyDes:"To know more please visit",mySchemeAppliedDes:"It seems you have already initiated your application earlier. Please click on check status to view more details.",appStatus:"Check Application Status",channel:"Channel",name:"Name",external:"External",externalDes1:"Redirected to ",externalDes2:" for application. Please visit ",externalDes3:" to track further status.",Relevance:"Relevance","Scheme Name (A->Z)":"Scheme Name (A->Z)","Scheme Name (Z->A)":"Scheme Name (Z->A)",altImage:"myScheme Image",aadhaar:"Aadhaar",noData:"No data found","Central Sector Scheme":"Central Sector Scheme","Centrally Sponsored Scheme":"Centrally Sponsored Scheme",Online:"Online",Offline:"Offline",online:"Online",offline:"Offline","Online - via CSC":"Online - via CSCs",personalDetails:"Personal Details",seeSubmittedForm:"View submitted form",submittedFormTitle:"Submitted form",continueForm:"Continue Application","In Kind":"In Kind",Composite:"Composite",Cash:"Cash",trackingId:"Tracking Id",schemeName:"Scheme Name",appliedOn:"Applied On",action:"Action",savedSearches:"Saved Profiles",addProfile:"Add Profile",savedData:"Saved Data",noSavedSearches:"You don't have any saved search profile",new:"New",selectSearchPlaceholder:"Past searches",selectRelationPlaceholder:"Select One",selectSearchQuestion:"Select an option to update past search or create a new search",selectRelationQuestion:"What is your relationship with this person?",selectSearchQuestionError:"Please select a search",saveSearch:"Do you want to save this results?",saveSearchQuestion:"Who are you saving this results for?",saveSearchPlaceholder:"Enter name",saveSearchError:"Please enter a name!",saveSearchFor:"Are you saving this result for yourself?",saveSearchForError:"Please select an option!",save:"Save",saveResults:"Save Profile",loginToSaveSearch:"You need to first sign in to save the search!",schemesApplied:"Schemes Applied",noNewsUpdates:"No new news and updates available",profileTab1:"Profile",profileTab2:"My Activity",profileTab3:"My Applications",applicationStatus:"Application Status",phone:"Phone",dob:"Date of Birth",newsAndUpdates:"News and Updates",login:"Sign In",logout:"Sign Out",logoutConfirmation:"Are you sure you want to sign out?",loginToApply:"You need to sign in before applying for schemes",linkCopied:"Link copied to clipboard",copy:"Copy",share:"Share",bookmarkAdded:"Bookmark added",bookmarkRemoved:"Bookmark removed",loginToBookmark:"Sign in to bookmark",loginToProfile:"Sign in to view profile",noBookmarks:"You don't have any bookmarks",noProfile:"You haven't created any profile",noApplications:"You haven't applied for any schemes",cancel:"Cancel",removeAll:"Remove All",confirmation:"Are you sure?",bookmarks:"Bookmarks",bookmark:"Bookmark",profile:"Profile",myApplications:"My Applications",applications:"Applications",activities:"My Activities",somethingWentWrong:"Something went wrong. Please try again later.",openMenu:"Open Menu",home:"Home",navTab1:"Categories",navTab2:"How it Works",navTab3:"About",navTab4:"Contact Us",navTab5:"FAQs",langEng:"English",langHindi:"\u0939\u093f\u0902\u0926\u0940",heroHeading1:"Finding",heroHeading2:"Government Schemes",heroHeading3:"made easy !",heroHashTag1:"#GOVERNMENTSCHEMES",heroHashTag2:"#SCHEMESFORYOU",or:"or",checkEligibility:"Check Eligibility",applyNow:"Apply Now",loginToApplyBtn:"Sign in to apply",schemes:"Schemes",scheme:"Scheme",findSchemes:"Find Schemes For You",findSchemeHint:"Enter some basic details to find eligible Government Schemes.",categoriesHead:"Categories",categoriesSubHead:"Find schemes based",categoriesSubHead2:"on categories",howItWorksHead:"How it works",howItWorksSubHead:"Easy steps to apply",howItWorksSubHead2:"for Government Schemes",hiwStep1Head:"Enter Details",hiwStep1:"<span>Start by entering your <strong>basic details!</strong></span>",hiwStep2Head:"Search",hiwStep2:"<span>Our search engine will <strong>find the relevant schemes</strong>!</span>",hiwStep3Head:"Select & Apply",hiwStep3:"<span><strong>Select and apply</strong> for the best suited scheme</span>",aboutSubHead:"Get your government scheme here!",aboutHead:"About",aboutDesc1:"myScheme is a National Platform that aims to offer one-stop search and discovery of the Government schemes.",aboutDesc2:"It provides an innovative, technology-based solution to  discover scheme information based upon the eligibility of the citizen.",aboutDesc3:"The platform helps the citizen to find the right Government schemes for them. It also guides on how to apply for different Government schemes. Thus no need to visit multiple Government websites.",vision:"Our Vision",visionText:"Our vision is to make citizens life easier",mission:"Our Mission",mission1:"Our mission is to streamline the government - user interface for government schemes and benefits.",mission2:"Reduce time and effort required to find and avail a government scheme",aboutPageDesc1:"myScheme platform is Developed, Managed, and Operated by National e-Governance Division (NeGD), with the Support of Ministry of Electronics and Information Technology (MeitY), Department of Administrative Reforms and Public Grievance (DARPG) and in partnership with other Central and State Ministries/Departments.",eligibilityCheckHead:"Eligibility Check",eligibilityCheckDesc:"You can check your eligibility for schemes using different criteria and personal attribute",schemeFinderHead:"Scheme Finder",schemeFinderDesc:"Fast and easy searching with filter based drill downs for various Government Schemes",schemeInDetailHead:"Scheme in detail",schemeInDetailDesc:"Deep dive into dedicated scheme pages for fine grained scheme details before you apply",documentRequired:"Documents Requried",faqHead:"Frequently Asked Questions",faqSubHead1:"Checkout our knowledge base for some of your answers!",ques1:"What is myScheme, and how is it different from other government portals?",ans1:"myScheme is a national platform for accessing a wide range of government schemes from both the Central & State/UT Governments. It is a one-stop platform for search & discovery of government schemes based on demographic details. Unlike traditional government portals, myScheme brings together schemes from the Central Government, State Governments, and Union Territories on a single platform and helps users find relevant schemes based on their eligibility.",ques2:"How will myScheme help common citizens?",ans2:"The myScheme platform simplifies access to government schemes by enabling citizens to discover relevant schemes in one place, eliminating the need to visit multiple departmental websites or review extensive scheme guidelines to check their eligibility.",ques3:"How does myScheme work?",ans3:"The myScheme platform follows a simple and user-friendly three-step process to help citizens discover government schemes for which they are eligible: Step 1: The user enters basic details such as demographic, income, social category, etc. Step 2: Based on the information provided, myScheme displays relevant schemes from hundreds of government schemes for the user. Step 3: The user can select from the list of eligible schemes and get more information from the dedicated scheme page with detailed knowledge, FAQs, and application process and navigate to the respective application URL to apply.",ques4:"What is the procedure for knowing the right scheme on the myScheme platform?",ans4:"To find the right scheme on the myScheme platform, citizens can begin by visiting the platform's official website. Once on the homepage, they will find the 'Find Schemes for You' feature, which allows users to enter their demographic details, such as age, gender, income level, category, etc. Once these details are submitted, the platform will provide a list of relevant schemes based on the user's profile.",ques5:"What information about a particular scheme can I find on myScheme?",ans5:"The myScheme platform provides comprehensive information on each scheme, including eligibility criteria, benefits offered, application procedure, and the documents required to avail the scheme. It also features a dedicated Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs) section to address common queries related to the scheme.",ques6:"What are the broad categories under which schemes are available on myScheme?",ans6:"The schemes available on the myScheme platform are broadly classified into 15 categories based on their nature of benefits and target beneficiaries. These categories include Agriculture, Rural & Environment; Banking, Financial Services & Insurance; Business & Entrepreneurship; Education & Learning; Health & Wellness; Housing & Shelter; Public Safety, Law & Justice; Science, IT & Communications; Skills & Employment; Social Welfare & Empowerment; Sports & Culture; Transport & Infrastructure; Travel & Tourism; Utility & Sanitation; and Women & Child.",ques7:"Does the myScheme platform provide multilingual support?",ans7:"Yes, the myScheme platform currently supports content in 15 languages, including English. Support for additional Indian languages will be provided soon.",ques8:"Does the myScheme platform showcase both Central and State/UT-specific schemes?",ans8:"Yes, the myScheme platform currently provides access to over 4,700 Central Government and State/UT Government schemes. Additional schemes will continue to be onboarded on the platform on an ongoing basis.",ques9:"I could not find a specific scheme on the myScheme platform. What should I do?",ans9:'Currently, more than 4,700 Central Government and State/UT Government schemes have been onboarded on the myScheme platform. Additional schemes are being added on a regular basis. Citizens may share details or suggestions regarding any missing scheme through the "Get in Touch" section available on the platform.',ques10:"I found some errors in the content of the schemes in the Marathi language. What should I do?",ans10:"In case any discrepancy is noticed in the Marathi version of the scheme content, citizens are advised to refer to the English version for clarification. If the issue persists, the respective Ministry's or Department's official portal may be referred to for the most accurate and updated information. Additionally, the issue may be reported by sending an email to support-myscheme[at]digitalindia[dot]gov[dot]in.",ques11:"I want to explore schemes under which scholarships are provided to students. Is this possible through myScheme?",ans11:"Yes, the myScheme platform offers a keyword-based search feature that enables citizens to easily search, explore, and identify schemes based on the type and extent of benefits provided, including scholarships for students.",ques12:"I want to apply for a specific scheme and would like to know the documents required for application. Can I find this information on myScheme?",ans12:"Yes, the myScheme platform provides a complete list of documents required for applying to each scheme, enabling citizens to prepare and apply with ease.",ques13:"Can I apply for schemes through myScheme?",ans13:"Currently, the myScheme platform redirects users to the respective scheme application page of the concerned Ministry or Department. In upcoming phases, it is envisaged that citizens will be able to apply for schemes through myScheme portal/UMANG application.",ques14:'To explore schemes best suited to a user, what details need to be provided in the "Personalised Search" feature of myScheme?',ans14:'To use the "Personalised Search" feature of myScheme, users are required to provide basic profile details such as gender, age, marital status, state, place of residence (urban or rural), social category, disability status, minority status, employment status, and other relevant information. This helps in identifying schemes most relevant to the user\'s profile.',ques15:'What is the "Check Eligibility Questionnaire" feature?',ans15:'The "Check Eligibility Questionnaire" feature focuses on scheme-specific eligibility criteria and enables users to verify their eligibility through a simple Yes/No-based questionnaire. Based on the responses provided, users can quickly assess whether they are eligible for a particular scheme.',ques16:"Does myScheme have a chatbot facility, and how does it help citizens?",ans16:"Yes, myScheme has deployed a voice-enabled, multilingual AI-powered chatbot to assist citizens in discovering relevant government schemes. The chatbot provides personalized and instant responses to user queries, simplifies scheme discovery through conversational assistance, and enhances government-citizen interaction by offering an engaging and user-friendly experience.",ques17:"What are the key features of the AI Chatbot on myScheme?",ans17:"The myScheme AI Chatbot offers voice and text-based interactions, bilingual support in Hindi and English, context-aware conversations, session-based chat history, and options to copy and share responses, ensuring a seamless and user-friendly experience.",ques18:"How can I provide my feedback regarding the content of the schemes?",ans18:'myScheme platform offers a "Was this helpful?" feedback section at the bottom of each scheme page, allowing users to rate the content from 1 to 5 stars and share their experiences, suggestions, or feedback. Users can also send detailed feedback via email to support-myscheme@digitalindia.gov.in, helping ensure continuous improvement and responsiveness of the platform.',ques19:"How can a user sign up or sign in on myScheme?",ans19:"myScheme is integrated with MeriPehchaan (National Single Sign-On), enabling users to sign up or sign in using their MeriPehchaan credentials. Users can browse and search government schemes without signing in. However, signing in allows users to save their profile, bookmark schemes, and receive personalized recommendations based on their saved details.",ques20:"How can I search a scheme on the myScheme platform?",ans20:"The myScheme platform provides multiple ways to search and discover schemes, including search by scheme name or keywords, personalized recommendations, filtering by State/UT or Central Government schemes, browsing by scheme benefit categories, and using the AI-powered chatbot for guided assistance.",viewMore:"View More",yourNameLabel:"Your Name"},(0,xe.Z)(K,"contactUs","Contact Us"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"emailLabel","Email"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"phoneLabel","Phone"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"addressLabel","Address"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"commentsLabel","Comments"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"captchaLabel","Captcha"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"needHelp","Need any help?"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"contactUsText","Contact us for any help or to join our team"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"getInTouch","Get in touch"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"address","4th Floor, NeGD, Electronics Niketan, 6 CGO Complex, Lodhi Road, New Delhi - 110003, India"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"websiteRelated","Website Related"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"contentRelated","Content Related"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"webmaster","Webmaster"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"informationManager","Web Information Manager"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"usefulLinks","Useful Links"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"quickLinks","Quick Links"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"siteName","myScheme"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"reservedRights","All Rights Reserved"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"poweredBy","Powered by"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"meity","MeitY"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"governmentOfIndia","Government of India"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"screenReader","Screen Reader"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"website","Website"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"freeCommercial","Free / Commercial"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"free","Free"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"commercial","Commercial"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"screenReaderText","myScheme complies with World Wide Web Consortium (W3C) Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.0 level AA. This will enable people with visual impairments access the platform using assistive technologies, such as screen readers. The information of the platform is accessible with different screen readers, such as JAWS."),(0,xe.Z)(K,"srTD1","Non Visual Desktop Access (NVDA)"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"srTD2","System Access To Go"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"srTD3","Hal"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"srTD4","JAWS"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"srTD5","Supernova"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"srTD6","Window-Eyes"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"screenReaderInfo","Information related to the various screen readers"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"sitemap","Sitemap"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"websitePolicy","Website Policies"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"accessibilityStatement","Accessibility Statement"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"accessibilityStatementText","<p>We are committed to ensure that the myScheme app is accessible to all users irrespective of device in use, technology or ability. It has been built, with an aim, to provide maximum accessibility and usability to its visitors. As a result this platform can be viewed from a variety of devices such as Desktop / Laptop computers, web-enabled mobile devices; etc.</p><p>We have put in our best efforts to ensure that all information on this platform is accessible to people with disabilities. For example, a user with visual disability can access this platform using assistive technologies, such as screen readers and screen magnifiers.</p><p>We also aim to be standards compliant and follow principles of usability and universal design, which should help all visitors of this platform.</p><p>This platform is designed using latest technologies such as React JS, Next JS to meet Guidelines for Indian Government Websites and also adheres to level A of the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.0 laid down by the World Wide Web Consortium (W3C). Part of the information in the platform is also made available through links to external Websites. External Websites are maintained by the respective departments who are responsible for making these sites accessible.</p><p>myScheme is working towards making its platform accessible for persons with disabilities, however currently Portable Document Format (PDF) files are not accessible. In addition, information provided in Hindi language is also not accessible.</p><p>If you have any problem or suggestion regarding the accessibility of this platform, please write to us support-myscheme[at]myScheme[dot]gov[dot]in to enable us to respond in a helpful manner. Do let us know the nature of the problem along with your contact information.</p>"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"privacyPolicy","Privacy Policy"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"hyperlinkPolicy","Hyperlinking Policy"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"termsOfUse","Terms of Use"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"terms","Terms & Conditions"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"copyrightPolicy","Copyright Policy"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"termsConditions","<p>terms & conditions</p>"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"copyrightPolicyText","Material featured on this platform may be reproduced free of charge. However, the material has to be reproduced accurately and not be used in a derogatory manner or a misleading context. Wherever the material is being published or issued to others, the source must be prominently acknowledged. However, the permission to reproduce this material shall not extend to any material which is identified as being copyright of a third party (user-submitted content). Authorization to reproduce such material must be obtained from the copyright holder concerned."),(0,xe.Z)(K,"privacyPolicyText","<p>myScheme does not automatically capture any specific personal information from you, (like name, phone number or e-mail address), that allows us to identify you individually. If the myScheme requests you to provide personal information, you will be informed for the particular purposes for which the information is gathered and adequate security measures will be taken to protect your personal information. We do not sell or share any personally identifiable information volunteered on the myScheme to any third party (public/private). Any information provided to this platform will be protected from loss, misuse, unauthorized access or disclosure, alteration, or destruction. We gather certain information about the User, such as Internet protocol (IP) addresses, domain name, browser type, operating system, the date and time of the visit and the pages visited. We make no attempt to link these addresses with the identity of individuals visiting our site unless an attempt to damage the site has been detected.</p>"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"hyperlinkPolicyText","<p><strong>Links to external websites/platforms</strong></p> <p> At many places in this platform, you shall find links to other websites/platforms. The links have been placed for your convenience. myScheme is not responsible for the contents and reliability of the linked websites and does not necessarily endorse the views expressed in them. Mere presence of the link or its listing on this platform should not be assumed as endorsement of any kind. We cannot guarantee that these links will work all the time and we have no control over availability of linked pages.</p> <p><strong>Links to myScheme by other websites</strong></p> <p>We do not object to you linking directly to the information that is hosted on this site and no prior permission is required for the same. However, we would like you to inform us about any links provided to this platform so that you can be informed of any changes or updations therein. Also, we do not permit our pages to be loaded into frames on your site. The pages belonging to this site must load into a newly opened browser window of the User.</p>"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"termsText1","<p>These terms of use describe your rights and responsibilities as a user of the https://www.myscheme.gov.in . To have a myScheme account, you must accept these terms of use.</p><p>MeitY and Govt. of India reserve the right to make changes to myScheme and these terms of use at any time. If those changes affect your rights or responsibilities, you will be notified through myScheme. </p><p>The following terms of use supersede and replace any terms and conditions you may have previously accepted governing your use of myScheme. The following Terms & Conditions come into effect as soon as you have accepted it and created your myScheme account.</p><p>As a user of myScheme you are granted a nonexclusive, nontransferable, revocable, limited license to access and use myScheme and content following these Terms of Use. The provider may terminate this license at any time for any reason.</p><p>myScheme is designed by NeGD & hosted by Amazon Web Services (AWS),and Contents are provided by the various Organizations, Departments, and Ministries of the Government of India.</p><p>Though all efforts have been made to ensure the accuracy of the content on myScheme, the same should not be construed as a statement of law or used for any legal purposes. In case of any ambiguity or doubts, users are advised to verify/check with the concerned Ministry/Department/Organization and/or other source(s), and to obtain appropriate professional advice.</p><p>Under no circumstances will the Government Ministry/Department/Organization be liable for any expense, loss, or damage including, without limitation, indirect or consequential loss or damage, or any expense, loss, or damage whatsoever arising from use, or loss of use, of data, arising out of or in connection with the use of myScheme.</p>"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"termsHead1","LIMITATION ON USE:"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"termsText2","<p>Any unauthorized use of myScheme is prohibited. The use of any software (e.g. bots, scraper tools) or other automatic devices to access, monitor, or copy the platform pages is prohibited unless expressly authorized by the myScheme in writing.</p>"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"termsHead2","POLICY CONCERNING YOUR CONTENT:"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"termsText3","<p>Uploading content or submitting any materials for use on myScheme, you grant (or warrant that the owner of such rights has expressly granted) myScheme a perpetual, worldwide, royalty-free, irrevocable, non-exclusive right and license, with a right to sublicense, to use, reproduce, modify, adapt, publish, publicly perform, publicly display, digitally display and digitally perform translate, create derivative works from and distribute such materials or incorporate such materials into any form, medium, or technology now known or later developed throughout the universe. You agree that you shall have no recourse against Provider for any alleged or actual infringement or misappropriation of any proprietary right in your communication to us. </p>"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"termsHead3","USER RESPONSIBILITY:"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"termsText4","<p>You must:</p>"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"termsPoints","<li>Be a natural person to access or seek to access myScheme or a Member Service;</li><li>Not access or link to or seek to access or link to (either directly or indirectly) any other person's myScheme or Member Service account;</li><li>Not permit any other person to use your username and password; keep your myScheme account username, and password, at all times and not disclose your password to anyone else;</li><li>Report the HelpDesk immediately if you suspect that the security of your myScheme account may have been compromised e.g.: your password or username has been lost or stolen. Contact myScheme using the details at Contact Us;</li><li>Ensure your details (including your name and date of birth) are accurate and keep up to date with myScheme;</li><li>You are responsible for any use of your myScheme account using your username and password, whether or not such use has been authorized by you.</li><li>Details on myScheme may only be accessed through the myScheme, and only using the username and authentication details that have been specifically allocated to you.</li><li>You must use myScheme and your myScheme account only for lawful purposes and in a manner that does not infringe the rights of or restrict or inhibit the use of myScheme by any third party. This includes conduct that is unlawful or which may harass or cause distress or inconvenience to any person, the transmission of obscene or offensive content, or disruption to myScheme.</li>"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"termsHead4","INFORMATION THAT YOU PROVIDE ON myScheme:"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"termsText5","<p>If within your myScheme account, you are asked to provide information, the information you supply must be complete and accurate. You acknowledge that if you supply incomplete, inaccurate, or false information, use myScheme to perform (or attempt to perform) an unauthorized action, or otherwise misuse myScheme, it may suspend or terminate your myScheme access.</p><p>Giving false or misleading information is a serious offense. Providing incomplete, inaccurate, or false information via myScheme will be treated in the same way as providing incorrect information on a form or in person and may result in prosecution and civil or criminal penalties.</p>"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"securityPolicy","Security Policy"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"securityText","The myScheme is hosted by Amazon Web Services(AWS). Therefore, all security issues related to the platform of this Department will be addressed by the NeGD. NeGD may carry out required security audits as and when required, as per security guidelines."),(0,xe.Z)(K,"monitoringPolicy","Monitoring Policy"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"monitoringText","myScheme team will monitor the myScheme platform periodically to address and fix the quality and compatability issues namely, performance, functionality, broken links, traffic analysis and feedback from visitors."),(0,xe.Z)(K,"contingencyManagement","Contingency Management"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"contingencyText","The myScheme platform need to be functional and running at all times to provide information and services to the users. The myScheme platform is hosted by Amazon Web Services and AWS will make efforts to minimize the downtime of the platform as far as possible by taking immediate steps as and when required. In eventualities like defacement/hacking of the site, data corruption, hardware/software crash and natural disasters, AWS will make all efforts to restore the site in the shortest possible time. It is the responsibility of AWS to keep the platform data at a disaster recovery site located at a remote location for recovery purposes."),(0,xe.Z)(K,"tcForURLHosting","T&C for URL Hosting"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"urlHostingHeading","Partners' Terms & Conditions for Hosting myScheme URL on Third-Party Websites"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"urlSubHeading1","1. Integrity of the myScheme URL"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"urlSubHeading2","2. Security Requirements"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"urlSubHeading3","3. Positive Representation"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"urlSubHeading4","4. Relevant Placement"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"urlSubHeading5","5. Compliance with Legal and Regulatory Frameworks"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"urlSubHeading6","6. Prohibition of Misuse"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"urlSubHeading7","7. Indemnity"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"urlSubHeading8","8. Disclaimer of Warranties"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"urlSubHeading9","9. Termination"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"urlSubHeading10","10. Support and Resources"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"urlSubHeading11","11. Intellectual Property"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"urlSubHeading12","12. Amendment"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"urlSubHeading13","13. Limitation of Liability"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"urlSubHeading14","14. Severability"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"urlSubHeading15","15. Governing Law, Jurisdiction and Dispute Resolution"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"urlSubHeading1Text","<span>1.1 The myScheme URL must remain in its original form, directing users to the official myScheme portal without modification, shortening, masking, or embedding in any content, including iframes or redirection services.</span><span>1.2 The URL must always direct users to the official myScheme.gov.in website without any intermediary pages, pop-ups, or content layers.</span><span>1.3 We do not permit myScheme\u2019s pages to be loaded into frames on Your site. The pages belonging to the myScheme website must load into a newly opened browser window of the User.</span>"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"urlSubHeading2Text","<span>2.1 The Party must implement robust security protocols, including HTTPS encryption, firewall protections, and regular penetration testing, to protect user data and the integrity of the URL.</span><span>2.2 The Party must comply with established security standards, including the OWASP Top 10 for web security vulnerabilities.</span><span>2.3 Any security breach must be reported to the myScheme team within 24 hours, and immediate actions must be taken to mitigate the breach.</span><span>2.4 Regular security audits, including third-party assessments, must be conducted to ensure ongoing compliance with security standards.</span>"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"urlSubHeading3Text","<span>3.1 The myScheme URL must be hosted alongside content that accurately reflects myScheme\u2019s purpose and does not mislead users. It must not be hosted on pages containing defamatory, obscene, misleading, or otherwise inappropriate content that violates public policy or community standards.</span><span>3.2 The myScheme team reserves the right to review the placement of the URL on partner websites.</span>"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"urlSubHeading4Text","<span>4.1 The URL must be placed in relevant sections of the third-party website that align with the purpose and services of myScheme, with priority given to visible, user-friendly areas (e.g., above the fold or within a dedicated government services section).</span><span>4.2 The URL must not be placed in a context that may confuse users about myScheme\u2019s nature or its government affiliation.</span>"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"urlSubHeading5Text","<span>5.1 You will comply with all applicable law, regulation, and third party rights (including without limitation laws regarding the import or export of data or software, privacy etc.).</span><span>5.2 You shall adhere to the prevalent data protection laws and regulations including without limitation the Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023, and the Information Technology Act, 2000, or any Rules or Regulations framed therein, and other relevant prevalent laws/rules/ordinances/notifications/bylaws, etc. at the time of usage while handling the data accessed or obtained by You under these Terms.</span><span>5.3 You shall not process any data that is governed under any specific law or regulation that requires separate consent or approval without obtaining the said consent or approval from the competent authority.</span><span>5.4 The Party must ensure that any third-party services or platforms used in relation to hosting the URL are compliant with relevant laws.</span>"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"urlSubHeading6Text","<span>6.1 The myScheme URL must not be used in any manner that is deceptive, misleading or unlawful, including but not limited to unlawful redirections, phishing, or other malicious activities. You are prohibited from using the URL must not be used in a manner that misrepresents or diminishes the credibility of myScheme.</span><span>6.2 The URL shall not be used in commercial advertisements, promotions, or profit-driven activities without prior written consent of myScheme.</span>"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"urlSubHeading7Text","<span>You (as an \u201cIndemnifying Party\u201d), to the maximum extent permitted by law, shall defend, protect, and indemnify Us (as an \u201cIndemnified Party\u201d). The Indemnifying Party shall hold the Indemnified Party and their officers, employees, directors, and consultants, as the case may be (all Third-Party referred to in this clause as 'Indemnified Parties'), harmless from and against any and all proven or alleged losses, demands, damages, liabilities, interest, awards, judgments, settlements, fines, penalties, and compromises relating to any Third Party claims, actions, causes of action, or suits arising out of, due to, or in connection with, directly or indirectly, the performance or non-performance of these Terms or breach of any warranty, representation, or covenant contained herein. The obligation to indemnify shall extend to and encompass all costs and expenses incurred by the Indemnified Party in defending such claims, demands, lawsuits, or actions, including, but not limited to, attorney, witness, and expert witness fees, and any other litigation- related expenses.</span>"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"urlSubHeading8Text",'<span>8.1 The APIs are provided "as is" without warranty of any kind. We disclaim all warranties, express or implied, including but not limited to warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, and non-infringement.</span><span>8.2 The Party shall be solely responsible for any and all risks associated with hosting the myScheme URL, including but not limited to cybersecurity threats, reputational damage, or legal consequences.</span><span>8.3 myScheme shall not be liable for any damages, losses, or liabilities arising from the Party\'s actions or omissions related to hosting the URL. The Party shall be responsible for ensuring compliance with all applicable security protocols, laws, and regulations.</span>'),(0,xe.Z)(K,"urlSubHeading9Text","<span>9.1 myScheme reserves the right to order immediate removal and You shall be required to immediately remove the URL from Your website if You are found in violation of any of the Terms.</span><span>9.2 The Party must comply with any such order of removal within forty-eight (48) hours of receiving such communication.</span>"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"urlSubHeading10Text","<span>myScheme may, at its discretion, provide resources or guidelines to assist the Party in complying with these Terms, including best practices for URL placement, security measures, and content hosting.</span>"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"urlSubHeading11Text","<span>a. All the intellectual property rights and interests including without limitation, trade mark, copyright, designs, or patents in the website shall exclusively belong to Us. These Terms in no manner grant You any ownership rights or exclusivity over the website.</span><span>b. You will not make any statement regarding Your hosting/hyperlinking of the web site that suggests partnership with, sponsorship by, or endorsement by Us without Our prior written approval.</span><span>c. We allow a hyperlink that only displays Our name or website address. Any use or display of myScheme logos, trade names, and trademarks as a hyperlink will not be allowed.</span>"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"urlSubHeading12Text","<span>We reserve the right to modify these Terms at any time, with or without notice. You are requested to periodically review these terms for your continued usage/hosting of myScheme URL.</span>"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"urlSubHeading13Text","<span>In no event shall We be liable for any indirect, special, incidental, or consequential damages arising out of or in connection with your usage/hosting of the myScheme URL, regardless of the cause of action (whether in contract, tort, breach of warranty, or otherwise) and even if We has been advised of the possibility of such damages.</span>"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"urlSubHeading14Text","<span>If any provision of these Terms is determined to be unenforceable for any reason, then the remaining provisions hereof shall remain unaffected and in full force and effect.</span>"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"urlSubHeading15Text","<span>Any complaints, grievances, or concerns regarding the Platform, its content, or its services, shall be first directed to the CTO, NeGD, Digital India Corporation and be mutually resolved through mediation.</span><span>These Terms shall be governed according to the Indian laws and each Party shall submit to the jurisdiction of the Courts at Delhi, India.</span><span>Any differences or disputes arising out of these Terms including any question regarding its existence, validity, or termination shall be resolved mutually by the parties through negotiations.</span><span>In case of non-resolution of disputes as mentioned above, the dispute shall be referred to Arbitration of a Sole Arbitrator mutually appointed by both the parties and in terms of the Arbitration and Conciliation Act, 1996. The place and seat of the arbitration shall be at New Delhi and proceedings shall be conducted in English language. The parties shall resort to litigation as a last resort only if the alternative dispute resolution mechanisms fail to resolve the dispute.</span>"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"urlHostingText1",'<p>These Terms of Use ("Terms") govern your ("You/Your/Party") hosting and usage of myScheme\u2019s URL on your website. By hosting or using myScheme\u2019s URL ("Platform/We/Us/Our"), You agree to be strictly bound by these Terms and that the Terms control your relationship with us. Read all the Terms carefully. If You do not agree to these Terms, Kindly refrain from hosting or using myScheme\u2019s URL on your website for any purpose. Any deviation from or misuse of these Terms will be considered a breach of these Terms and shall result in immediate termination to host/use the URL on your website.</p><p>You may not host the URL and may not accept the Terms if (a) you are not of legal age to form a binding contract with Us, or (b) you are a person barred from using or hosting the URL under any applicable laws. If you are hosting the URL on behalf of an entity, you represent and warrant that you have the authority to bind that entity to the Terms and by accepting the Terms, you are doing so on behalf of that entity (and all references to "You" in the Terms refer to that entity).</p><p>To host the URL You may be required to provide certain information (such as identification or contact details) so that You can be informed of any changes or updation therein. Ensure that any information provided to Us by You will always be accurate and up to date and You will inform us promptly of any updates. We shall use submitted information in accordance with the applicable Privacy Policy.</p>'),(0,xe.Z)(K,"cap","Content Archival Policy (CAP)"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"cmap","Content Contribution, Moderation & Approval Policy (CMAP)"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"crp","Content Review Policy (CRP)"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"gender","Gender"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"maritalStatus","Marital Status"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"beneficiaryState","Beneficiary State"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"residence","Residential Area"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"caste","Caste"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"disability","Disability"),(0,xe.Z)(K,"disabilityPercentage","Disability Percentage"),(0,xe.Z)(K